+## Owner-driven quiet-writer protection
+
+- Quiet local/worker Action and Processor writers survive multiple protection periods on both transports without worker-job renewal calls.
+- Appends, append retries and reconnects never renew protection or revive an old attempt.
+- Each bounded owner renewal proves the catalog-bound exact attempt and current worker session where applicable; revocation during policy or commit refuses stale renewal.
